{"id":"e2ce95effee3aac32ad950f91ae38a30aea948af","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/eFLQ0PfFrKc5kRSs.html","title":"深度拆解 Sonnet 5.5 ：半价 Opus 只是表象，Agent Runtime 才是变化核心","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"Tool Call 少三成，Shell Run 近减半，迭代降至 3.6 次。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"深度拆解 Sonnet 5.5 ：半价 Opus 只是表象，Agent Runtime 才是变化核心\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafN0oA8Gpf2WuM4g0vXhzsib0GJV41XqdoEOSNEzK2j9dP8vqlPs1KMXEBVX1g6vgsy9bfuk86kjd8h8LD5AuvlhzswjvMNeI25Y/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100262738\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abc695800045.jpg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abc695800045.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Tool Call 少三成，Shell Run 近减半，迭代降至 3.6 次。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-la